        "timingFunction": "ease-out"
      }
    },
    "bottom-sheet": {
      "$type": "transition",
      "$description": "Slide up, swipe or scrim to dismiss",
      "$value": {
        "duration": "240ms",
        "timingFunction": "ease-out"
      }
    },
    "toast-in": {
      "$type": "transition",
      "$description": "Visible 4s",
      "$value": {
        "duration": "200ms",
        "timingFunction": "ease-out"
      }
    },
    "toast-out": {
      "$type": "transition",
      "$value": {
        "duration": "160ms",
        "timingFunction": "ease-out"
      }
    }
  },
  "rules": {
    "$description": "Usage rules in plain language, so people and AI assistants apply the system the same way.",
    "$extensions": {
      "duescape.rules": [
        "Reference semantic tokens in product code. Never use a primitive or a raw hex value on a screen.",
        "Green (status/success) is for status only, never for brand accents.",
        "Status is never carried by colour alone: every badge pairs a tone with a glyph.",
        "Cancelling or deleting is a destructive button plus a confirmation dialog, never a toggle.",
        "Currency format: symbol first, no space, comma decimal, dot thousands (€1.595,28). Use tabular figures wherever amounts align.",
        "Touch targets are 44 x 44 minimum. Text pairings must pass WCAG AA (4.5:1); disabled controls are the only exception.",
        "Spinners are allowed inside a button only. Use skeletons wherever the layout is predictable.",
        "Amounts never animate or count up on load."
      ]
    }
  }
}